  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.05 Extension",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.05 “Extension” means written notification to the municipal assessing officials by the owner, no later than March 31, that the cutting operation will extend beyond April 1.",
